# TomatoNovel QX filter v1.0 - 2026-10-27
# Adapted from sve1r/Rules-For-Quantumult-X
# Conservative mode: protect Douyin live streams and shared ByteDance services.
# Subscribe as filter_remote with policy REJECT; do not combine with original TomatoNovel.list.
#
# Fanqie-specific logging / tracking
host-wildcard,frontier*-toutiao-lf.fqnovel.com,reject
host-wildcard,log*-applog-*.fqnovel.com,reject
host-wildcard,mon*-misc-lf.fqnovel.com,reject
host-wildcard,rtlog*-applog-*.fqnovel.com,reject
#
# Ad SDK infrastructure (potential overlap with main adblock list)
host-suffix,api-access.pangolin-sdk-toutiao.com,reject
host-wildcard,api-access.pangolin-sdk-toutiao*.com,reject
host-wildcard,lf*-ad-union-sdk.pglstatp-toutiao.com,reject
host-wildcard,p*-ad-sign.byteimg.com,reject
host-wildcard,ads*-normal-*.zijieapi.com,reject
#
# Intentionally excluded:
# pull-*.douyincdn.com and p*-webcast-sign.douyinpic.com: Douyin livestream
# *.snssdk.com, broad *.zijieapi.com, *.bytegecko.com: cross-app impact
# novelapp/reading/video CDNs and 6 unverified fixed IPs: content-breakage risk
